    locator "rev-proc/87-56/asset-class/39.0";
    text en official """39.0    Manufacture of Athletic, Jewelry and Other Goods:
        Includes assets used in the production of jewelry; musical instruments; toys and sporting
        goods; motion picture and television films and tapes; and pens, pencils, office and art
        supplies, brooms, brushes, caskets, etc. .                                                                     l2                             12

